{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-barca-stars",
  "title": "Interlaced stars of the Sala de la Barca (Alhambra)",
  "fold": 4,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data15/CM052: Alhambra, Sala de la Barca",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data15/CM052.html",
      "note": "The design was read from his line drawing; the construction, shared with the Comares bath stars, is ours."
    },
    {
      "source": "Photograph SPA 1624x (Sala de la Barca)",
      "creator": "David Wade",
      "url": "https://patterninislamicart.com/",
      "note": "The real panel, used to check the wall."
    }
  ],
  "photos": [
    {
      "file": "alhambra-wichmann/wade-spa_1624x.jpg",
      "caption": "The panel in the Sala de la Barca, Alhambra (photo SPA 1624x).",
      "creator": "David Wade",
      "license": "All rights reserved",
      "url": "https://patterninislamicart.com/",
      "private": true
    }
  ],
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of a large star.",
    "A": "Halfway from O to the next large star along the axis."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through O and A and draw a circle about O through A. A large star will sit at O and at every point two radii away along the diagonals.",
      "create": {
        "c": { "circle": { "centre": "O", "through": "A" } },
        "h": { "line": { "through": ["O", "A"] } }
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O. At the four points where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them. Draw the circle about O through their corners: it meets the horizontal and vertical at the four corners of the square cell. Rule the cell’s four sides and its two diagonals through O.",
      "create": {
        "v": { "line": { "through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "P0": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 0.0 } } },
        "P180": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 180.0 } } },
        "P90": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 90.0 } } },
        "P270": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 270.0 } } },
        "gx": { "line": { "through": "P0", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "gxw": { "line": { "through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "gy": { "line": { "through": "P90", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "gys": { "line": { "through": "P270", "perpendicularTo": "v" } },
        "K": { "point": { "meet": ["gx", "gy"] } },
        "K2": { "point": { "meet": ["gxw", "gy"] } },
        "K3": { "point": { "meet": ["gxw", "gys"] } },
        "K4": { "point": { "meet": ["gx", "gys"] } },
        "d45": { "line": { "through": ["O", "K"] } },
        "d135": { "line": { "through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45" } },
        "cd": { "circle": { "centre": "O", "through": "K" } },
        "C0": { "point": { "meet": ["cd", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 0.0 } } },
        "C90": { "point": { "meet": ["cd", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 90.0 } } },
        "C180": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cd", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 180.0 } }
        },
        "C270": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cd", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 270.0 } }
        },
        "w1": { "line": { "through": ["C0", "C90"] } },
        "w2": { "line": { "through": ["C90", "C180"] } },
        "w3": { "line": { "through": ["C180", "C270"] } },
        "w4": { "line": { "through": ["C270", "C0"] } }
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Rule the vertical through O. Where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them on the right and the top. Draw the circle about O through their corners: it meets the horizontal and vertical at the four corners of the square cell. Rule the cell’s top two sides and its two diagonals through O."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rule the line halving the angle between the horizontal and the diagonal: the 22.5° line.",
      "create": {
        "r22": { "line": { "through": "O", "bisects": ["P0", "O", "K"] } }
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rule the line from the corner K to the bottom of the circle. Where it crosses the 22.5° line, rule a vertical down to the horizontal: that point is the tip of the large star. Draw the circle about O through it.",
      "create": {
        "kq": { "line": { "through": ["K", "P270"] } },
        "Q": { "point": { "meet": ["kq", "r22"] } },
        "qv": { "line": { "through": "Q", "perpendicularTo": "h" } },
        "B0": { "point": { "meet": ["qv", "h"] } },
        "cb": { "circle": { "centre": "O", "through": "B0" } }
      },
      "highlight": ["K", "P270"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The large star is two squares in this circle. Mark where the circle meets the horizontal, the vertical and the two diagonals, and join every other mark: one square on the horizontal and vertical marks, one on the diagonal marks. Rule each side as a full line.",
      "create": {
        "B90": { "point": { "meet": ["cb", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 90.0 } } },
        "B180": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "h"], "pick": { "angle": 180.0 } }
        },
        "B270": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "v"], "pick": { "angle": 270.0 } }
        },
        "B45": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "d45"], "pick": { "angle": 45.0 } }
        },
        "B135": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "d135"], "pick": { "angle": 135.0 } }
        },
        "B225": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "d45"], "pick": { "angle": 225.0 } }
        },
        "B315": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cb", "d135"], "pick": { "angle": 315.0 } }
        },
        "bs0": { "line": { "through": ["B0", "B90"] } },
        "bd45": { "line": { "through": ["B45", "B135"] } },
        "bs90": { "line": { "through": ["B90", "B180"] } },
        "bd135": { "line": { "through": ["B135", "B225"] } },
        "bs180": { "line": { "through": ["B180", "B270"] } },
        "bd225": { "line": { "through": ["B225", "B315"] } },
        "bs270": { "line": { "through": ["B270", "B0"] } },
        "bd315": { "line": { "through": ["B315", "B45"] } }
      },
      "highlight": ["cb"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The next large star along sits two units away along the diagonal. Mark where circle c meets diagonal d45: P45. Put the compass on P45, open it to B45, and mark the other side along the diagonal: N45. Through that mark, rule the line parallel to the large star’s side bd45: a side of the neighbouring star.",
      "create": {
        "P45": { "point": { "meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": { "angle": 45.0 } } },
        "ca": { "circle": { "centre": "P45", "through": "B45" } },
        "N45": {
          "point": { "meet": ["ca", "d45"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } }
        },
        "nd": { "line": { "through": "N45", "parallelTo": "bd45" } }
      },
      "highlight": ["P45", "B45"],
      "animate": "compass",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The next large star along sits two units away along the diagonal. Mark where circle c meets diagonal d45: P45. Put the compass on P45, open it to B45, and draw the circle: it marks the neighbouring star’s tip on the other side."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Draw the circle about the top corner C90 with radius equal to B45–P45: the circle of the small square.",
      "create": {
        "cs": { "circle": { "centre": "C90", "radiusFrom": ["B45", "P45"] } }
      },
      "highlight": ["C90"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Mark where the circle cs meets the vertical line v. Through each mark rule lines parallel to the two diagonals: the sides of the small square.",
      "create": {
        "hy_c90": { "line": { "through": "C90", "parallelTo": "h" } },
        "S0": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "hy_c90"], "pick": { "angle": 75.361 } }
        },
        "S90": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "v"], "pick": { "farthest": "O" } }
        },
        "S180": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "hy_c90"], "pick": { "angle": 104.639 } }
        },
        "S270": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "v"], "pick": { "nearest": "O" } }
        },
        "S45": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "w2"], "pick": { "angle": 81.139 } }
        },
        "S135": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "w1"], "pick": { "angle": 98.861 } }
        },
        "S225": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "w2"], "pick": { "angle": 102.764 } }
        },
        "S315": {
          "point": { "meet": ["cs", "w1"], "pick": { "angle": 77.236 } }
        },
        "ss0": { "line": { "through": ["S0", "S90"] } },
        "sd45": { "line": { "through": ["S45", "S135"] } },
        "ss90": { "line": { "through": ["S90", "S180"] } },
        "sd135": { "line": { "through": ["S135", "S225"] } },
        "ss180": { "line": { "through": ["S180", "S270"] } },
        "sd225": { "line": { "through": ["S225", "S315"] } },
        "ss270": { "line": { "through": ["S270", "S0"] } },
        "sd315": { "line": { "through": ["S315", "S45"] } }
      },
      "highlight": ["cs"],
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Mark where the circle cs meets the vertical line v. Through each mark rule lines parallel to the two diagonals: the sides of the small square (its other sides are not needed)."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Copy the small square’s lines and the neighbouring star’s side to the other three corners, turning them about O.",
      "create": {
        "cp": {
          "repeat": {
            "of": [
              "nd",
              "ss0",
              "ss90",
              "ss180",
              "ss270",
              "sd45",
              "sd135",
              "sd225",
              "sd315"
            ],
            "by": "rot4"
          }
        }
      },
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Copy the small square’s lines to the other three corners, turning them about O."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Through the middles of the small square’s near sides, rule lines parallel to the cell sides: the bands that run past the small square.",
      "create": {
        "H1": { "point": { "meet": ["sd135", "hy_c90"] } },
        "H2": { "point": { "meet": ["sd315", "hy_c90"] } },
        "hv1": { "line": { "through": "H1", "parallelTo": "w2" } },
        "hh1": { "line": { "through": "H1", "parallelTo": "w1" } },
        "hv2": { "line": { "through": "H2", "parallelTo": "w2" } },
        "hh2": { "line": { "through": "H2", "parallelTo": "w1" } },
        "cq": { "repeat": { "of": ["hv1", "hh1", "hv2", "hh2"], "by": "rot4" } }
      },
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Through the middles of the small square’s near sides, rule lines parallel to the cell sides: the bands that run past the small square (lines that lie entirely outside are not needed)."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Mark the corners of the pattern: every point where a band turns, crosses another or ends.",
      "create": {
        "M1": { "point": { "meet": ["w3", "sd135@1"] } },
        "M2": { "point": { "meet": ["w2", "sd135@3"] } },
        "M3": { "point": { "meet": ["bs90", "sd135@1"] } },
        "M4": { "point": { "meet": ["bs180", "sd135@3"] } },
        "M5": { "point": { "meet": ["bd225", "hh1@2"] } },
        "M6": { "point": { "meet": ["bd45", "hv2"] } },
        "M7": { "point": { "meet": ["r22", "bd135"] } },
        "M8": { "point": { "meet": ["bs90", "bd135"] } },
        "M9": { "point": { "meet": ["bd135", "hh1@2"] } },
        "M10": { "point": { "meet": ["bs270", "sd135"] } },
        "M11": { "point": { "meet": ["bd135", "hv2"] } },
        "M12": { "point": { "meet": ["bs0", "sd135"] } },
        "M13": { "point": { "meet": ["bs180", "bd225"] } },
        "M14": { "point": { "meet": ["bd45", "bs90"] } },
        "M15": { "point": { "meet": ["w3", "sd135"] } },
        "M16": { "point": { "meet": ["w4", "sd315"] } },
        "M17": { "point": { "meet": ["bd225", "bs270"] } },
        "M18": { "point": { "meet": ["bs0", "bd45"] } },
        "M19": { "point": { "meet": ["bs180", "sd315"] } },
        "M20": { "point": { "meet": ["bd315", "hh1@3"] } },
        "M21": { "point": { "meet": ["bs90", "sd315"] } },
        "M22": { "point": { "meet": ["bd315", "hh1"] } },
        "M23": { "point": { "meet": ["bs270", "bd315"] } },
        "M24": { "point": { "meet": ["bd225", "hh1@3"] } },
        "M25": { "point": { "meet": ["r22", "bs0"] } },
        "M26": { "point": { "meet": ["bd45", "hh1"] } },
        "M27": { "point": { "meet": ["bs0", "sd135@1"] } },
        "M28": { "point": { "meet": ["bs270", "sd135@3"] } },
        "M29": { "point": { "meet": ["w4", "sd135@1"] } },
        "M30": { "point": { "meet": ["w1", "sd135@3"] } }
      },
      "animate": "fade"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "The tile is the square cell.",
      "create": { "tile": { "polygon": ["C0", "C90", "C180", "C270"] } },
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
  "ink": {
    "text": "Ink the bands: round each large star, and round the small square at each corner of the cell, the bands run on and cross between them.",
